WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.600
An isolated browser opens the existing QAIZEN Labs page.
This recording observes an existing site; it is not a benchmark.

00:04.600 --> 00:09.300
The readiness card opens its existing introduction.
Analytics consent is rejected in this isolated context.

00:09.300 --> 00:12.200
Start the check resolves to the first question.
No answer is selected and no result is submitted.

00:12.200 --> 00:14.200
The question's explanation opens.
DOM and screenshot artifacts record the expanded state.

00:14.200 --> 00:16.200
Space closes the focused native disclosure.
The keyboard action is recorded in the trace.

00:16.200 --> 00:21.160
Back restores the introduction and focuses its heading.
Accessibility audits and Core Web Vitals were not measured.
